WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.375
I have it all planned out.

00:00:01.458 --> 00:00:03.000
Pray tell.

00:00:03.083 --> 00:00:04.250
I'm getting...

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:06.083
two orders of bread sticks.
Two.

00:00:06.167 --> 00:00:08.000
Those things
knock your socks off.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:09.625
Enzo puts
some spice on 'em.

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.625
I don't know what it is,
but it's good

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:14.417
and you dip it in olive oil.
Forget about it.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.750
And I'm wavering
on the main course

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:18.375
between the veal
and the lasagne.

00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:20.625
But I think I gotta go
with lasagne, right?

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:23.417
Wait... So you--
you've been dreaming

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.333
about breadsticks
and lasagne.

00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:29.292
I've been on a diet
of watery soup,

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:30.875
mouldy bread and maggots.

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:32.333
So yeah, I've been dreaming

00:00:32.417 --> 00:00:34.208
about breadsticks
and lasagne.

00:00:34.292 --> 00:00:35.292
I mean, sue me.

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:39.583
Should I have been dreaming
about something else?

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:41.750
You tell me.

00:00:45.583 --> 00:00:46.417
Well.

00:00:47.625 --> 00:00:48.542
There's wine.

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:49.875
Oh, well wine's good.

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:51.750
I was thinking
about a nice Chi-anti.

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:54.333
-Chianti
-Chianti. Right.

00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:57.750
-And then there's dessert .
-You gotta have dessert.

00:00:57.833 --> 00:00:58.917
Gotta have dessert.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.542
And after that?

00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:04.375
I don't know.

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:07.542
Use your imagination.

00:01:09.542 --> 00:01:10.792
Who needs imagination?

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:24.542
Whoa.

00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:31.208
-Oh.
-Damn it.

